t;\">일부터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">일까지 영광군 불갑사관광지 일원에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">상사화 꽃길 속으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">천년의 사랑 속으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">를 주제로</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">다양한 공연</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문화</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">체험 프로그램과 함께 개최됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">가족</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">연인</span><span style=